		],
		"en": [
			"For GUNPLA fans around the world, this item is limited to the official GUNPLA complex \"GUNDAM Base\". A set of three types of debris parts and a pedestal inspired by the battlefield that can reproduce the battle scene in space is now available. In addition, a waterslide decal containing damage expression is included."
